    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403530/extras/7c94f8217e3e55c825664212b1cdb518.avif?t=1738157014\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnesian</strong> is a platformer game where you unravel the mysterious story of a character lost in time and space, blending pixel art with 3D graphics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and progress by switching between two parallel worlds in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The foes you face in combat will persist and chase you across level transitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 intense chapters, each offering unique storylines and gameplay mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403530/extras/4f51508a470b2edda4e2809049529357.avif?t=1738157014\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403530/extras/7c94f8217e3e55c825664212b1cdb518.avif?t=1738157014\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnesian</strong> is a platformer game where you unravel the mysterious story of a character lost in time and space, blending pixel art with 3D graphics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and progress by switching between two parallel worlds in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The foes you face in combat will persist and chase you across level transitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 intense chapters, each offering unique storylines and gameplay mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403530/extras/4f51508a470b2edda4e2809049529357.avif?t=1738157014\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
